// CLASS: W16.2-A op_new_array-typed-object-element (2026-05-18)
// Per ADR-006 §2.7.5 + audit v0.3-w16-v3s5-ckpt56-strict-close-audit.md §4.C —
// `Array<UserStruct>` literal + index access. Before W16.2-A landed both VM
// and JIT surfaced `op_new_array(2)` SURFACE; post-W16.2-A both Convergent
// at `2` via the v2-raw `TypedArray<*const TypedObjectStorage>` carrier
// (`NewTypedArrayTypedObject` + per-element `TypedArrayPushTypedObject`
// + `TypedArrayGetTypedObject` for the index access).
type B { v: int }
let arr = [B { v: 1 }, B { v: 2 }]
print(arr[1].v)
